<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Fleet Reviews - FleetGuide.in</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  
  <!-- Google AdSense -->
  <script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  
  <style>
    .reviews-content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }
    
    .review-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .review-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    
    .review-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    
    .review-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .rating {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .star {
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    
    .review-meta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .review-card p {
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .specs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 2px solid #F0F0F0;
    }
    
    .spec-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    
    .spec-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #999;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    
    .spec-value {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <nav>
      <a href="/" class="logo">FleetGuide.in</a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/gps-guides">GPS Guides</a></li>
        <li><a href="/transport-rules">Transport Rules</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#calculators">Calculators</a></li>
        <li><a href="/fleet-reviews">Fleet Reviews</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="reviews-content">
    <!-- Google AdSense Top Banner -->
    <div class="ad-container" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <ins class="adsbygoogle"
           style="display:block"
           data-ad-client="ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX"
           data-ad-slot="YYYYYYYYYY"
           data-ad-format="horizontal"
           data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins>
      <script>
           (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
      </script>
    </div>

    <section class="hero" style="padding: 3rem 0;">
      <h1>Fleet Vehicle Reviews</h1>
      <p>Expert reviews and comparisons of popular commercial vehicles in India</p>
    </section>

    <div class="review-card">
      <div class="review-header">
        <h3>Tata Ace Gold</h3>
        <div class="rating">
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star" style="color: #ddd;">★</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="review-meta">
        <span>📅 Updated: January 2026</span>
        <span>🏷️ Category: Mini Truck</span>
      </div>
      
      <p>
        The Tata Ace Gold is a popular choice for small businesses and last-mile delivery services. 
        With its compact size and impressive payload capacity, it offers excellent maneuverability 
        in urban environments. The fuel efficiency is commendable for its class, making it a 
        cost-effective solution for daily operations.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        <strong>Pros:</strong> Affordable maintenance, good mileage, reliable engine, easy to drive
      </p>
      
      <p>
        <strong>Cons:</strong> Limited cabin comfort, basic features, not ideal for long distances
      </p>
      
      <div class="specs">
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Payload Capacity</span>
          <span class="spec-value">750 kg</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Engine Power</span>
          <span class="spec-value">16 HP</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Mileage</span>
          <span class="spec-value">18-20 km/l</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Price Range</span>
          <span class="spec-value">₹4-4.5 Lakhs</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="review-card">
      <div class="review-header">
        <h3>Mahindra Bolero Pik-Up</h3>
        <div class="rating">
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="review-meta">
        <span>📅 Updated: January 2026</span>
        <span>🏷️ Category: Light Commercial Vehicle</span>
      </div>
      
      <p>
        The Mahindra Bolero Pik-Up is a rugged workhorse designed for tough Indian conditions. 
        Its powerful mHAWK engine and superior build quality make it ideal for both rural and 
        urban commercial applications. The vehicle offers excellent value for money with low 
        maintenance costs and high reliability.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        <strong>Pros:</strong> Powerful engine, excellent build quality, good ground clearance, 
        comfortable for long hauls
      </p>
      
      <p>
        <strong>Cons:</strong> Slightly higher initial cost, moderate fuel efficiency in city conditions
      </p>
      
      <div class="specs">
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Payload Capacity</span>
          <span class="spec-value">1,250 kg</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Engine Power</span>
          <span class="spec-value">75 HP</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Mileage</span>
          <span class="spec-value">15-17 km/l</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spec-item">
          <span class="spec-label">Price Range</span>
          <span class="spec-value">₹8-9 Lakhs</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Google AdSense In-Content Ad -->
    <div class="ad-container" style="margin: 2rem 0;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
