      <p>
        Ashok Leyland Dost+ bridges the gap between mini trucks and full-sized commercial vehicles. 
        It's particularly popular among fleet operators for its optimal balance of payload capacity 
        and running costs. The i-GEN technology ensures better fuel efficiency and lower emissions.
      </p>
      
