    <div class="review-card">
      <div class="review-header">
        <h3>Eicher Pro 2049</h3>
        <div class="rating">
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
          <span class="star">★</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="review-meta">
        <span>📅 Updated: January 2026</span>
        <span>🏷️ Category: Medium Commercial Vehicle</span>
      </div>
      
      <p>
        The Eicher Pro 2049 is an excellent choice for medium-duty applications. With its proven 
        Volvo technology and robust Indian engineering, it offers superior performance and reliability. 
        The vehicle is particularly appreciated for its driver comfort and modern cabin design.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        <strong>Pros:</strong> Powerful engine, excellent build quality, driver-friendly cabin, 
        low operating costs
      </p>
      
      <p>
